# Old Experimental / product bookmarks → the final shop URL.
# 301, one hop. A 302 to /shop.html would hop again: Pages 308s *.html
# to the extensionless path. Do not add a /* splat here — it can intercept
# POST /api/contact on the custom domain (Pages still serves 404.html for
# unknown static paths). Existing *.html pages stay files; Pages already
# 308s those to extensionless URLs, so old .html addresses keep working.
/experimental.html    /shop    301
/experimental         /shop    301
/product.html         /shop    301
/product              /shop    301
